<BaseLayout>
	<section class="hero-section page-section">
		<div class="container">
			<Image src={Headshot} alt="headshot of briana" width={320} height={320} class="headshot" />
			<div class="text-block">
				<h1 class="h5"><SplitText text="Hi, I'm Bri" /></h1>
				<p>A creative technologist and Shopify developer based in Atlanta.</p>
				<p>I help agencies, nonprofits, and founders create marketing & ecommerce experiences that are conversion-focused, technically considered, and feel like a natural extension of their brand.</p>
				<!-- <p>I build bespoke websites and conversion-focused landing pages that feel like an extension of your brand, and a natural meeting place for your community.</p> -->
				<p>My work is a product of design, engineering, and creative curiosity, and I'm at my best on projects with room to actually think.</p>
				<p>The best way to know if I'm the right fit is to reach out and tell me what you're building. I'm also open to full time and contract remote roles in UX design, frontend, design engineering, or creative technology.</p>
				<p>Interested in working with me? <Link href="mailto:work@brianagude.com">say hi</Link> (:</p>
			</div>
			<div class="accordion">
			<details>
				<summary><h3 class="h6">What I Can Help With</h3></summary>
				<div class="accordion-body">
					<ul>
						<li>
							<b>Web design and UX:</b> sitemaps, wireframes, full-fidelity comps, design systems, component libraries, etc all with a strong foundation in visual hierarchy, and content strategy. I can own the design end-to-end or slot in wherever you need me.
						</li>
						<li>
							<b>Custom Shopify builds:</b> full design and development, both custom themes and headless, built mobile-first and shaped around your brand.
						</li>
						<li>
							<b>Website refreshes:</b> reworking layout, flow, and visual presentation to sharpen what's already there and convert better while doing it.
						</li>
						<li>
							<b>Conversion-focused landing pages:</b> standalone pages built around a single goal, with a focus on hierarchy, narrative, and friction.
						</li>
						<li>
							<b>Light CRO audits and eCommerce consulting:</b> a practical pass through your site flagging friction points and quick wins, or a broader conversation about what's working and what isn't.
						</li>
						<li>
							<b>Creative and interactive web experiences:</b> a completely bespoke experience shaped around your brand's personality.
						</li>
						<li>
							<b>Ongoing support and retainers:</b> post-launch ownership scoped to what you actually need.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</details>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
